  "post_content": "<p>(19 fotos) L&#39;ondera Rebeca Brun Santiago &eacute;s l&#39;autora del cartell per a Fira d&rsquo;Onda 2018, que se celebrar&agrave; del 6 al 28 d&#39;octubre. Un jurat format per representants del m&oacute;n de la cultura, el disseny i la festa ha elegit l&#39;obra guanyadora entre les 16 que s&#39;havien presentat.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g_4RvLWuzEQ\" target=\"_blank\">Les persones interessades podran visitar la mostra dels cartells del 6 al 16 de setembre</a>, a la sala d&#39;exposicions de la Casa de la Cultura.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfiraonda2018/img_2832.jpg\" alt=\"img_2832\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfiraonda2018/img_2833.jpg\" alt=\"img_2833\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfiraonda2018/img_2834.jpg\" alt=\"img_2834\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfiraonda2018/img_2835.jpg\" alt=\"img_2835\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfiraonda2018/img_2836.jpg\" alt=\"img_2836\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfiraonda2018/img_2838.jpg\" alt=\"img_2838\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfiraonda2018/img_2840.jpg\" alt=\"img_2840\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfiraonda2018/img_2841.jpg\" alt=\"img_2841\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cartellfiraonda2018/img_2842.jpg\" alt=\"img_2842\"